WEBVTT

00:13:29.836 --> 00:13:31.316
At that stage, then,

00:13:31.356 --> 00:13:34.236
me and the rest of the team
are able to study the ichthyosaur

00:13:34.276 --> 00:13:35.956
in as much detail as possible

00:13:35.996 --> 00:13:41.276
and then prepare it
for its eventual display at Rutland,

00:13:41.316 --> 00:13:43.116
where it will then attract,

00:13:43.156 --> 00:13:45.836
hopefully millions of people
will travel around the world

00:13:45.836 --> 00:13:48.716
to come and see this specimen,
marvel at this Jurassic giant,

00:13:48.756 --> 00:13:51.596
and understand the hidden history
right beneath their feet.

00:13:54.716 --> 00:13:56.676
What an incredible journey.

00:13:57.956 --> 00:14:01.556
With most fossil finds,